                            <comment id="15763635" author="avinogradov" created="Tue, 20 Dec 2016 08:34:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Initially reproduced. Reproducer added to issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15764520" author="avinogradov" created="Tue, 20 Dec 2016 16:01:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Problem found. &lt;br/&gt;
cctx.mvcc().addAtomicFuture(...) happens not under topology.readlock (it already released)&lt;br/&gt;
So, exchange is not waiting for putAll operation finish.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Dummy hotfix (relocation of this code to readlock section solved the issue).&lt;br/&gt;
Fixing code in proper way.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
